      <li>Media kit: traffic by country (US/UK focus), viewability, newsletter open rate</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:ads@rentfreenews.com">ads@rentfreenews.com</a> — we share GA4 + Search Console redacted screenshots.</p>
